  "question": {
    "html": "<p>The distance from a star to a planet is <em>s</em>. The power radiated by the star is <em>X</em>. The planet’s surface has albedo <em>y</em>. </p>\n<p>How much energy does each square metre of the planet absorb per second?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{X(1-y)}{4\\pi s^{2}}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{Xy}{4\\pi s^{2}}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4\\pi s^{2}Xy\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4\\pi s^{2}X(1-y)\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
  },
